{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>A sabbath of solemn rest it shall be for the land.</b> Also from all the implements of agricultural work, such as manuring the saplings and smearing and puncturing the unripe fruit and the like, which they of blessed memory mentioned (Avodah Zarah 50a)." "<b>A sabbath to HaShem.</b> For even those who work the land, when they rest in that year, will be stirred to seek HaShem in some manner."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:50.887429606Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}